      "releaseNotes": "What's New in Version 2.0\n\n• Added Modern and Matte fridge collections, refreshed Retro interiors, and introduced more colors and unique layouts.\n• Added a dynamic calendar that automatically displays the local date, monthly calendar, and yearly progress. Add it to your fridge design and save it as part of your Lock Screen wallpaper. No calendar permission required.\n• Added a CD music magnet featuring three original DuoFridge tracks, with background playback and playback controls on the Lock Screen and in Control Center.\n• Added Open Fridge and Close Fridge features for standard iPhones.\n• Introduced Kim, a virtual assistant available across Retro, Modern, and Matte fridges. Turn Kim on or off anytime from the interior menu.\n• Customize the fridge interior and exterior independently, with separate options to save, clear, or restore default layouts.\n• Added and updated magnets and decorative items for more personalization options.\n• Improved high-resolution wallpaper saving.\n• Improved menu interactions.\n• Added a Quick Guide in four languages.\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements.",
