      "description": "DuoFridge — Create Your Own Lock Screen\n\nMake your iPhone Lock Screen truly yours!\n\nDuoFridge lets you decorate beautifully designed fridges with photos, calendars, notes, and magnets to create your own unique Lock Screen wallpaper.\n\n15 Beautiful Fridge Styles\n- Choose from 15 designs, including Retro, Modern Metallic, and Matte finishes.\n- Each fridge includes a matching interior. Customize both sides your way.\n\nMake It Your Own\n- Photos: Add your favorite people, pets, and memories.\n- Magnets: Add, move, resize, and arrange freely.\n- Calendars: Add dates, monthly calendars, and yearly progress to your wallpaper.\n- Notes: Write to-do lists, reminders, and personal goals.\n- Free Editing: Adjust the position and size of every element.\n\nTwo Sides. Two Wallpapers.\n- Design the fridge exterior and interior separately, then save each as a high-resolution image.\n- Set your creations as your iPhone Lock Screen wallpaper.\n\nSpatial Lock Screen Effects\n- Supports iPhone's Spatial Scene feature, adding greater depth and dimension to your Lock Screen.\n- Spatial Scene requires iPhone 12 or later running iOS 26 or later. Actual visual effects may vary depending on the image.\n\nExclusive Original Music\n- Enjoy DuoFridge's original music while creating your wallpaper, even offline.\n\nFrom photos to magnets, every detail is yours to customize.\n\nStart creating your own iPhone Lock Screen with DuoFridge!",
